 ### Cross-View Pruning Mechanism
-Uses a Cross-View Consistency Loss and adaptive pruning based on depth consistency ($d^i_p < 0.01 \land d^j_p < 0.5 \lor d^i_p > 3\sigma$) to reduce redundancy [S9].
